# Authorized Ed25519 client keys
# Generate a compact client key and one entry with the uv-run script
# from the tunnel-rs repo (key file to stdout, entry to stderr):
# scripts/generate-auth-key.py "alice laptop" > client.key 2>> authorized_keys
#
# Format: ed25519-pub:<unpadded url-safe base64 32-byte public key>[ comment]
# One space separates the key from the comment, which runs to end of line.
# ed25519-pub:1bhGIken5UAXTkC7cABRzM4cE98xZl3tilGyYZsoyP8 alice laptop
